# Heavy / regenerable capture artifacts stay out of git; the analysis scripts,
# decoded summaries, and the reverse-engineering evidence (axio-re-*/) stay
# tracked. Raw buffers and full exports can be re-decoded from the Pi snapshot
# with decode_buffer.py / generate_report.py.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.json
*.csv
*.pdf
emu_*.png

# ...but keep the Axio reverse-engineering candump evidence. These are raw
# field captures (the car is gone — not reproducible) and back FINDINGS.md.
# Overrides the root .gitignore's global *.log rule.
!axio-re-20260529/*.log
